@@ -77,0 +78,4 @@ tools/mc.sh paper-26.2 deploy > deploy.out 2>&1
+The menu checks open the wiki before the first reload, check its shipped loot order, open a loot page and return, click a claim row, and check the direct `claim all` behavior and console player-only replies. Add `--after-reload` for a second complete run against the same installed jar, configuration and database. That mode verifies the jar hash, starts the existing install and reloads it before the checks. Both modes reset only the stopped test bots' player files.
+
+Known Windows OSHI crash-report preload diagnostics are printed separately as external diagnostics, with their full traces retained in the report. The matcher recognizes only the named Perflib-009 registry error and the three `SystemReport` null-process diagnostics. A RakunLoots frame, any plugin ERROR or any other unexpected startup exception still fails the run. `python -m unittest discover -s tools -p test_rltest_startup.py` checks this attribution. No Windows registry repair or JVM workaround is required for these tests.
+
